{"ticker":"KLAC","updated":"2026-10-30T22:55:43Z","profile":{"longName":"KLA Corporation","shortName":"KLA Corporation","sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductor Equipment & Materials","country":"United States","website":"https://www.kla.com","fullTimeEmployees":17000,"marketCap":206073577472,"trailingPE":39.576443,"forwardPE":22.452467,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":14.206294,"pegRatio":1.6,"targetMeanPrice":225.07692,"targetHighPrice":325.0,"targetLowPrice":175.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":26,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.289,"earningsGrowth":0.393,"grossMargins":0.61465,"operatingMargins":0.45011002,"profitMargins":0.3625,"totalRevenue":14505794560,"beta":1.447,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":307.37,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":107.196,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.55},"summary":"KLA Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, provides process control and process-enabling solutions for manufacturing wafers, reticles/masks, chemicals/materials, integrated circuits (ICs), packaged ICs, and printed circuit boards. It operates through three segments: Semiconductor Process Control; Specialty Semiconductor Process; and PCB and Component Inspection. The company offers inspection and review tools to identify, locate, characterize, review, and analyze defects on various surfaces of patterned and unpatterned wafers; chemical process control equipment; wired and wireless sensor wafers and reticles; wafer defect inspection, review, and metrology systems; reticle inspection and metrology systems; wafer inspection and metrology systems; semiconductor software solutions; KLA Pro systems; and specialty semiconductor manufacturing, benchtop metrology, surface characterization, material strength characterization, and electrical property measurement products. It also provides etch, plasma dicing, deposition and other wafer processing technologies and solutions; direct imaging, inspection, optical shaping, inkjet, and additive printing, as well as computer-aided manufacturing and engineering solutions; and components. In addition, the company offers service programs. It serves semiconductor, and semiconductor-related and electronic device manufacturers. The company operat","summary_zh":"KLA Corporation 及其子公司為晶圓、光罩版/掩模、化學品/材料、積體電路 (IC)、封裝 IC 和印刷電路板的製造提供製程控制和製程支援解決方案。它透過三個部門運作：半導體製程控制；特種半導體製程； PCB 和元件檢查。該公司提供檢測和審查工具來識別、定位、表徵、審查和分析圖案化和非圖案化晶圓的各種表面上的缺陷；化學過程控制設備；有線和無線感測器晶圓和掩模版；晶圓缺陷檢查、審查和計量系統；掩模版檢查和計量系統；晶圓檢查和電氣計量系統；還提供蝕刻、等離子切割、沉積等晶圓加工技術和解決方案；直接成像、檢測、光學成型、噴墨和增材印刷，以及電腦輔助製造和工程解決方案；和組件。此外，該公司還提供服務計劃。它為半導體、半導體相關和電子設備製造商提供服務。公司經營","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"半導體設備與材料","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":84.584,"h":85.285,"l":83.673,"c":84.635,"v":12416000},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":84.766,"h":84.766,"l":83.224,"c":84.39,"v":9336000},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":84.32,"h":87.666,"l":83.9,"c":87.329,"v":8134000},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":87.963,"h":90.626,"l":87.834,"c":90.509,"v":11556000},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":91.0,"h":92.435,"l":90.674,"c":90.898,"v":8865000},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":91.075,"h":92.275,"l":91.023,"c":91.773,"v":6778000},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":92.186,"h":93.523,"l":91.49,"c":93.263,"v":7128000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":94.0,"h":96.389,"l":93.748,"c":95.928,"v":10221000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":95.748,"h":96.809,"l":95.5,"c":96.402,"v":5839000},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":96.699,"h":99.0,"l":96.699,"c":98.891,"v":8456000},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":99.35,"h":100.204,"l":97.506,"c":99.057,"v":7761000},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":99.038,"h":100.0,"l":97.627,"c":98.987,"v":7239000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":103.083,"h":107.679,"l":102.579,"c":104.669,"v":18247000},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":105.19,"h":105.248,"l":102.932,"c":104.481,"v":15869000},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":103.889,"h":107.297,"l":103.75,"c":107.125,"v":10207000},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":106.785,"h":107.552,"l":106.079,"c":107.12,"v":8295000},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":106.632,"h":107.6,"l":105.764,"c":106.867,"v":8680000},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":105.861,"h":106.699,"l":104.58,"c":105.91,"v":7105000},{"